        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAs">IV As</ref> 6.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Si libera mulier sit, præcipitetur de clivo vel submergatur.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">In the case of a free woman, she shall be thrown from a cliff or drowned.</ab>
